"河灯里的字" = "Words on a River Lantern";
"一盏逆水漂来的河灯，灯底是母亲的字。" = "A lantern drifting upstream, with her mother’s handwriting on its base.";
"阿禾" = "Ahe";
"替人捎信的姑娘。" = "A girl who carries letters for other people.";
"梁婆婆" = "Granny Liang";
