"旧渡口只有梁婆婆替人捎过家书。" = "At the Old Ferry, only Granny Liang ever carried family letters for others.";
"梁婆婆接过灯，指腹在灯骨上摩了一下。她说这灯是她扎的。" = "Granny Liang takes the lantern and runs her thumb along its ribs. She says she made it herself.";
"梁婆婆交出半封旧信" = "Granny Liang hands over half an old letter";
"阿禾答应守密，梁婆婆交出半封旧信。" = "Ahe promises to keep quiet, and Granny Liang hands over half an old letter.";
"梁婆婆从船篷底下摸出一封信，撕掉的那半在她自己手里。" = "Granny Liang pulls a letter from under the boat canopy; the torn half stays in her hand.";
"赶集的人认出纸张" = "The market crowd knows the paper";
"卖纸老人认出纸张来自旧渡口。" = "The old paper seller recognizes paper from the Old Ferry.";
"赶集的人围着河灯看。卖纸的老人伸手摸了摸，说这纸他送过。" = "People from the market gather around the lantern. The old paper seller touches the sheet and says he once delivered this paper.";
