"阿禾读懂母亲当年离镇的缘由，把回信交给梁婆婆。" = "Ahe understands why her mother left town and gives the reply to Granny Liang.";
"旧渡口只剩半截石阶。阿禾把两半信对起来，母亲的字终于读得通。" = "Only half the stone steps remain at the Old Ferry. Ahe fits the two halves of the letter together, and at last her mother’s words read cleanly.";
"她没有把信带走，交给了梁婆婆。" = "She does not take the letter with her; she gives it to Granny Liang.";
"梁婆婆交出半封旧信，阿禾独自去渡口" = "Granny Liang hands over half the letter; Ahe goes to the ferry alone";
"赶集的人认出纸张来自旧渡口，众人一同前往" = "The market crowd recognizes paper from the Old Ferry, and they go together";
